ind":"announcement","title":"Drunk Woodcutter releases December 2nd!","summary":"The firewood has been stacked, the whiskey poured, and the chalkboard has spoken:Drunk Woodcutter releases on December 2, 2026!I've got a lot in store for the adventurous lumberjack: more unhinged \"axes\", challenging wood types, and other ridiculous stuff. Want a first taste? The demo is out, and it’s part of Steam Next Fest (October 19-26). Go hurt yourself for beer money!Wishlist the game to get notified on launch day!Cheers,ElSchorscho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T21:45:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521770-1843481262688719","game_id":"steam-4521770","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix #1","summary":"Howdy Woodcutters!While you were hard at work earning some serious beer money in the demo ($ 37m were earned in total so far!), some of you have run across the occasional bug-infested log and were kind enough to report them. Thank you! So, here's the first hotfix for the demo:Fixed: Wood pieces can no longer get stuck in the pickup truck's bed, blocking spawning of new logs (seriously though, what a trickshot - hat off to you, sir!)Fixed: \"Get back to work\" button was occasionally not working fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T11:13:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688719","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521770-1842846814453469","game_id":"steam-4521770","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is live, go hurt yourself for beer money!","summary":"Chop wood, drink booze, hack yourself in the kneecaps, and spend yo